    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n67464" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">μην-ᾰγύρτης</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ου</span>,
